  "title": "Zai Lab Announces Updates to China’s National Reimbursement Drug List",
  "summary": "SHANGHAI & CAMBRIDGE, Mass.–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Dec. 7, 2025–Zai Lab Limited (NASDAQ: ZLAB; HKEX: 9688) today announced that the following medicines and indications have been renewed in the 2025 National Reimbursement Drug List (NRDL) released by China’s National Healthcare Security Administration (NHSA): VYVGART® (efgartigimod alfa injection) is renewed for the treatment of adult patients with generalized myasthenia […]",
